{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/52766f9dcf4d3035bae32c3eeaaa8c6d.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/52766f9dcf4d3035bae32c3eeaaa8c6d.webm?t=1758211316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Potions: The Alchemist\u2019s Shop</strong> is a relaxing cozy-game where you grow enchanted herbs, brew charming elixirs and run the friendliest little alchemist shop in town. Tend a moonlit garden, watch your cauldron come alive with color and welcome curious visitors who browse and buy your latest creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/9f2dcd4d904cab4b4b7ee82820a87ba3.avif?t=1758211316\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f<u>Plant and nurture</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy seeds from your recipe-book, prepare soft soil, sow sprouts, water them and watch them flourish through three stages before they yield fragrant ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/0f968c8255969d6a25fd566ffd323db6.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/0f968c8255969d6a25fd566ffd323db6.webm?t=1758211316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd28<u><strong>Process and brew</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each herb has one perfect workstation: dry, grind, mince or mix it, then tip the result into the cauldron and enjoy the swirl of bubbles and aromas. But be warned, mishandled mixes can still end in a spectacular puff of smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/e5fa66a289bfad349c27a47618c56f00.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/e5fa66a289bfad349c27a47618c56f00.webm?t=1758211316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea<strong><u>Taste your magic</u></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlock pages in your recipe book, discover dozens of brews from common tonics to legendary elixirs, and sip a few yourself for gentle buffs like quick feet or hidden-ingredient vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/07affeb2affc14b37a3a2939d1d15617.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/07affeb2affc14b37a3a2939d1d15617.webm?t=1758211316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2697\ufe0f<strong><u>Open shop</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange bottles on shelves, greet townsfolk as they wander and watch the gold roll in. Special characters may appear, from a wealthy magnate who buys in bulk to a mischievous thief you can shoo away and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/c1539d5887730b6edda454247cc710e1.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/c1539d5887730b6edda454247cc710e1.webm?t=1758211316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<u><strong>Upgrade and expand</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade every workstation, shelf and garden pot through multiple tiers to speed production, hold more stock and boost profits. Each improvement transforms the look of your workshop and storefront as your snug boutique grows into the realm\u2019s most renowned apothecary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/1a64d2544c654b52b7ee78a2ecc2a6e8.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/1a64d2544c654b52b7ee78a2ecc2a6e8.webm?t=1758211316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/eab08ea43372a32b785d3272cc3cb12f.avif?t=1758211316\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709760?t=1758211316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709760?t=1758211316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/7498beac07ca6f409ea2f1ce45cb5f8818f8ac96/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758211316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/7498beac07ca6f409ea2f1ce45cb5f8818f8ac96/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758211316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/52766f9dcf4d3035bae32c3eeaaa8c6d.poster.avif?t=1758211316\" width=800 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709760/extras/52766f9dcf4d3035bae32c3eeaaa8c6d.webm